    "created_at": "2017-03-09T15:39:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-09T15:39:48Z",
    "body": "Oh, I didn't know that! So that means Chrome, Firefox, and Safari do indeed use the [[GetPrototypeOf]] hook and not look at the internal [[Prototype]] slot. So ECMAScript not changing would be against what browsers are doing.",
